        "text_UMFgJE": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>K-Swiss returns with a third installment of its collaboration with Rakeem Miles. Drop 3 is based on the classic Court Tie Break silhouette –reinvented through the lens of Rakeem’s lived experience and storytelling beyond the product.</p><p>“Action Figure Miles really comes from my childhood,” says Rakeem. “Growing up in foster care, dealing with mental health, and not always feeling safe, imagination was my escape. Creating this character was my way of turning pain into purpose. He represents healing, growth, compassion, resilience, and believing in yourself even when life hasn’t been easy. Stay true to who you are, even when it’s hard. That’s what this drop is about.”</p>"
