        "heading_3XDcYe": {
          "type": "heading",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Rakeem’s IMPACT",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "text_fqYMWi": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Drop 3 pushes that world forward visually and conceptually. The sneaker leads, but the story carries the weight. Custom packaging features messages like “Run Toward Greatness,” paired with playful interior graphics pulled from the Action Figure Miles universe. The release also includes a canvas tote and a rubberized hang tag created by Swapnice, embedded with NFC technology that unlocks exclusive content directly from Rakeem.</p><p>Rakeem remains hands-on across every creative touchpoint. This rollout expands the Action Figure Miles universe more than ever, channeling early-2000s energy through a styled photoshoot, a two-minute animated short starring the character, and a new skit continuing the narrative from previous drops. An eight-minute TV show pilot, originally developed with Adult Swim in mind, will also be available, alongside additional exclusive content, accessible through the Swapnice NFC experience.</p><p>Drop 3 amplifies the AFM x K-Swiss collaboration with its most personal chapter yet, grounded in real experience and led by Rakeem’s story from start to finish.<br/></p>"
          }
        }
      },
